    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d41">

                <pb facs="0128" n="48" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg48"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Emperor of Austria to
                        the President.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Vienna, Schoenbrunn</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-09-05"><hi rendition="#italic">September 5,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have received the news of your dangerous accident with deep sympathy and
                    express to you, Mr. President, my heartiest congratulations upon your escape
                    from this serious danger to life.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Franz Joseph.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
